          ("What is the car transport charge from Chandigarh to Mumbai?","Budget roughly Rs 13,000 to 22,000 for an Alto or i10, Rs 15,000 to 25,000 for a City or Slavia, Rs 17,000 to 28,000 for a Brezza or Creta and Rs 20,000 to 34,000 for an XUV700 or Fortuner, plus GST. A Mercedes or BMW in an enclosed carrier is roughly Rs 40,000 to 65,000 plus GST."),
