    dest="Pune homes for Tricity families tend to be in gated societies in Hinjewadi, Wakad, Baner, Kharadi or Wagholi, or in cantonment and defence housing for army postings. Societies ask for a move-in form, a gate pass and a lift slot. A verified partner team in Pune does the unloading. The June to September rain is steady rather than fierce, and the rest of the year is mild, which is kinder on furniture than a Chandigarh May.",
    tip="If the posting comes with defence accommodation in Pune, confirm the allotment date before the truck leaves Chandigarh. Where the quarter is not ready on arrival, storage in a partner warehouse can bridge the gap; it is billed as its own line on the estimate.",
