       "Hyderabad's tech and pharma growth pulls steadily from the Tricity. Engineers from the IT Park and Mohali's offices take roles in HITEC City and the Financial District, and life sciences staff join firms near Genome Valley. The Indian School of Business has campuses in both Mohali and Hyderabad, so faculty, staff and students move between them. Air force families posted to the academy at Dundigal add to the route.",
